  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PADANE- exit strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projet d&#x2019;Appui au D&#xe9;veloppement Agricole pour la Nutrition et l&#x2019;Entrepreneuriat</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the exit strategy and the closure phase

There is a five-month extension into 2025 in accordance with the extension plan, at no additional cost.

For the implementation of the exit strategy, there are five carefully selected priorities relating to the consolidation and sustainability of results and the strengthening of institutions.

6 months of operations from January to June 2025 for partners and the PADANE technical team, and

2 months for financial and administrative closure from July to August 2025 for all staff;

Final reporting from September to October 2025.

&#x200b;</narrative>
  </description>
